1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:01,273
RECALL.

2
00:00:01,273 --> 00:00:03,535
From a raw transcript to a decision.

3
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:05,750
A forty-minute rollout meeting.

4
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:07,404
Fifteen lines that matter.

5
00:00:07,404 --> 00:00:11,678
No decisions written down, no action list, no risk register.

6
00:00:11,678 --> 00:00:12,928
Just what people said.

7
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:21,083
The agent reads every line.

8
00:00:21,083 --> 00:00:25,976
It extracts decisions, actions, risks, gaps and open questions.

9
00:00:25,976 --> 00:00:29,964
Each one must point to the exact quote it came from, or it is not shown.

10
00:00:39,050 --> 00:00:40,142
Four decisions.

11
00:00:40,142 --> 00:00:42,238
Four actions with owners and dates.

12
00:00:42,238 --> 00:00:43,809
Three delivery risks.

13
00:00:43,809 --> 00:00:46,357
An unanswered question about on-call cover.

14
00:00:46,357 --> 00:00:48,714
And a gap: nobody owns the answer.

15
00:00:59,050 --> 00:01:01,214
This is the part a notebook cannot do.

16
00:01:01,214 --> 00:01:09,988
It raises the runbook the field team needs, the support rota that is still thin, the two customers waiting on bulk import, and the question nobody answered.

17
00:01:09,988 --> 00:01:13,821
Five things need a human, each with evidence and a reason.

18
00:01:21,050 --> 00:01:23,238
Connect the live PPMA first.

19
00:01:23,238 --> 00:01:25,500
The bridge keeps the tokens server side.

20
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:29,035
Then approve the findings: only the approved facts leave.

21
00:01:29,035 --> 00:01:30,833
PPMA accepts the event.

22
00:01:51,050 --> 00:01:55,345
The approved event is in the delivery log, and the live backend acknowledged it.

23
00:01:55,345 --> 00:01:57,535
PPMA owns project state from here.

24
00:02:09,050 --> 00:02:09,892
Ask later.

25
00:02:09,892 --> 00:02:11,654
What did we decide about onboarding?

26
00:02:11,654 --> 00:02:15,083
The answer cites the exact quote, speaker and time.

27
00:02:15,083 --> 00:02:17,750
If the evidence is absent, it refuses.

28
00:02:25,050 --> 00:02:31,785
A second, real openjiuwen agent can analyse the same case and PPMA memory through four read-only tools.

29
00:02:31,785 --> 00:02:34,714
It never sends, deletes or executes.

30
00:02:41,050 --> 00:02:42,500
This is the honest split.

31
00:02:42,500 --> 00:02:49,309
The analysis runtime, PPMA, the bridge, openjiuwen and the model endpoint are real and local.

32
00:02:49,309 --> 00:02:55,654
ASR, vendor connectors, identity, billing and cloud storage are still contracts or simulators.

33
00:02:59,050 --> 00:03:04,821
From a raw transcript to evidence-linked decisions, proactive risk and a human-approved handoff.

34
00:03:04,821 --> 00:03:05,857
That is RECALL.
